57
00:13:10.800 --> 00:13:14.339
Brian Ragazzi: In case anyone else wants to scrutinize the page, there it is.

58
00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:28.160
Brian Ragazzi: Usually, he puts those sorts of things in.

59
00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:30.090
